 "segments": [
  {
   "id": "s1",
   "text": "十年，結婚登記少了將近三成。",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 2.737,
   "speech_start": 0.229,
   "audio": "narration_v7.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": "s2",
   "text": "內政部統計，二〇一六年，十四萬七千多對。",
   "start": 2.706,
   "end": 6.201,
   "speech_start": 2.956,
   "audio": "narration_v7.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": "s3",
   "text": "二〇二五年，只剩十萬四千多對。",
   "start": 6.194,
   "end": 8.899,
   "speech_start": 6.444,
   "audio": "narration_v7.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": "s4",
   "text": "常說是不想結；數據還看到，結婚越來越晚。",
   "start": 8.892,
   "end": 12.707,
   "speech_start": 9.142,
   "audio": "narration_v7.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": "s5",
   "text": "平均初婚年齡，男三十三點四，女三十一點四歲。",
   "start": 12.7,
   "end": 16.621,
   "speech_start": 12.95,
   "audio": "narration_v7.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": "s6",
   "text": "同一年，總生育率只有零點六九五。",
   "start": 16.614,
   "end": 19.473,
   "speech_start": 16.864,
   "audio": "narration_v7.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": "s7",
   "text": "理由看不到：早點成家，還是等一等？",
   "start": 19.465,
   "end": 22.057,
   "speech_start": 19.715,
   "audio": "narration_v7.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": "s8",
   "text": "下集：剛出社會的月薪中位數。",
   "start": 22.049,
   "end": 24.704,
   "speech_start": 22.299,
   "audio": "narration_v7.wav"
  },
  {
   "id": "s9",
   "text": "想看完整資料，留言結婚。",
   "start": 24.824,
   "end": 29.199,
   "speech_start": 27.347,
   "audio": "narration_v7.wav"
  }
 ]
}